1
00:00:02,368 --> 00:00:04,207
哎呀 总算出场了
Ay, finally!

2
00:00:04,357 --> 00:00:07,217
看看谁穿着迷你比基尼闪亮登场了
Look who's wearing her itsy-bitsy bikini.

3
00:00:07,787 --> 00:00:09,408
同志之言 不算调戏
He can comment because he's gay.

4
00:00:09,417 --> 00:00:11,027
他是在说莉莉
He was talking about Lily.

5
00:00:11,057 --> 00:00:12,157
我也是
So was I.

6
00:00:12,166 --> 00:00:14,656
小卡 你把她打扮得太漂亮了
Ay, Cam, you make her look so pretty.

7
00:00:14,676 --> 00:00:16,006
猜猜谁圣诞节不过来了
Guess who's not coming for Christmas.

8
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,260
你比女儿抢镜多了
And the spotlight shifts.

9
00:00:17,526 --> 00:00:19,076
-老妈 她不来了 -什么
- Mom. She cancelled. - What?

10
00:00:19,096 --> 00:00:20,426
没有道歉 只有留言
In a voice mail, no less.

11
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:23,020
难以置信 好吧 其实完全可以置信
Unbelievable--and by that, I mean believable.

12
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,180
外婆为啥不来了啊
Why isn't Nana coming?

13
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:26,360
不知道 好像她新男友
I don't know. Something about her new boyfriend

14
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,160
硬要拽她去游轮巡航
whisking her away on a cruise.

15
00:00:28,335 --> 00:00:30,654
-她不来算是对我的大礼了 -什么男友
- I just got my gift. - What boyfriend?

16
00:00:30,674 --> 00:00:32,244
游轮船长卡尔
Carl the cruise ship captain.

17
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,740
她的节日简讯里写着呢
It was in her holiday newsletter.

18
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,880
那玩意我可读不下去
Oh, I can't read that whole thing. No.

19
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:39,000
是啊 前两页都在讲她勇救小鸟
Yeah, after two pages about the bird she rescued...

20
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:39,620
顺便一提
And by the way,

21
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:42,040
鸟都死了 怎么能算是救了它
I don't think you can say you rescued something if it dies.

22
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:44,280
-鸟死了吗 -她还为此写了首诗呢
- It died? - She wrote a poem about it.

23
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:46,600
在我看来 就算作为自由体诗歌也太过飘忽
A little too free with the free verse for my taste,

24
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,960
不过算了 姑且当它是首诗吧
but fine, we'll call it a poem.

25
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,900
我看到她写要起诉她的读书俱乐部时 就看不下去了
I stopped reading after she talked about suing her book club.

26
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:53,040
我只看到"亲爱的朋友们
Oh, I stopped reading after "Dear friends,

27
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,500
家人们以及闲杂人等..."
Family and others..."

28
00:00:54,692 --> 00:00:56,061
对不起 谁是"闲杂人等"
I'm sorry. Who are "Others"?

29
00:00:56,081 --> 00:00:58,431
-我呗 -你才不是...
- Me. - No, you're not...

30
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:00,040
好吧 也许是指你
Uh, maybe you are.

31
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:02,860
其实吧 她圣诞节表现算好的了
Actually, she's kind of at her best at Christmas.

32
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:03,980
她烤的"薄饼干"很不错
She makes a mean cookie.

33
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:05,860
她除了刻"薄"还会什么
What other kind could she possibly make?

34
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,570
真可怜
Aw, it's so sad that

35
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:10,440
今年你们不能和妈妈共度圣诞了
you guys are not gonna be with your mom this Christmas.

36
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,480
-其实还好 -岂止还好
- It's fine. - Yeah, it's more than fine.

37
00:01:12,490 --> 00:01:13,959
我们还是 我们别再谈妈了吧
Let's just-- can we move off of mom?

38
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:15,100
赶紧的
Yes, please.

39
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,560
米奇尔 往好的方面想
Yeah, and the upside now, Mitchell--

40
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:18,020
我们圣诞节可以去密苏里了
We can spend Christmas in Missouri

41
00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:20,360
那里才真的有圣诞气氛呢
where it actually feels like Christmas.

42
00:01:20,369 --> 00:01:22,298
等等 慢点 妈妈不来
Wait. Hang on a second. Just because Mom isn't coming

43
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:24,800
不代表我们不能在一起过圣诞啊
doesn't mean we're not gonna spend Christmas together.

44
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,420
与家人团聚才是重点啊
I mean, it's about family.

45
00:01:26,438 --> 00:01:27,898
你觉得我们是去密苏里看谁的 克莱尔
Who do you think we're seeing in Missouri, claire,

46
00:01:27,898 --> 00:01:28,938
-橡树岭男孩? -等等
- The Oak Ridge Boys? - Hold on.

47
00:01:28,938 --> 00:01:31,177
今年的平安夜不是说好一起过吗
I thought we were all getting together Christmas Eve this year.

48
00:01:31,207 --> 00:01:33,397
25号我们就飞去墨西哥了
We're on a flight to Mexico the 25th.

49
00:01:33,407 --> 00:01:35,627
说什么呢 你们25号就要飞走
What do you mean, you're getting on a flight on the 25th?

50
00:01:35,627 --> 00:01:37,017
是你们俩要和妈妈相处
You two needed time with your mom.

51
00:01:37,047 --> 00:01:38,987
我早就忍了你们的妈妈很多年了
I've already served my time with your mom.

52
00:01:38,997 --> 00:01:40,317
-老爸啊 -好吧
- Oh, Dad. - Well, uh,

53
00:01:40,336 --> 00:01:42,466
那我们什么时候过圣诞节呢
well, when are we gonna have Christmas then?

54
00:01:42,486 --> 00:01:44,976
我听说墨西哥有很多人贩子专门拐小孩
I heard kids are getting snatched in Mexico.

55
00:01:45,020 --> 00:01:45,440
什么
What?

56
00:01:46,056 --> 00:01:47,636
美国人贩子也不少
Kids get snatched here just as much.

57
00:01:47,636 --> 00:01:49,405
司空见惯了 别害怕
It happens all the time. Don't be scared.

58
00:01:49,975 --> 00:01:51,155
"司空见惯"难道是指...
Now when you say "All the time"

59
00:01:51,155 --> 00:01:52,775
好了 下周末怎么样
Okay, well what about next weekend?

60
00:01:52,775 --> 00:01:54,115
因为我们21号前在家 对吧
Cause we're only home till the 21st, right?

61
00:01:54,115 --> 00:01:56,665
我们明天离家 21号才回来
Yeah, we leave tomorrow and we don't come back until the 21st.

62
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,620
数学精 能帮我拿杯柠檬水吗
Hey, math club, could you get me some more lemonade?

63
00:01:59,420 --> 00:02:01,020
难道说今天是圣诞节前
Are we saying that this is the last time

64
00:02:01,020 --> 00:02:03,600
我们全家人最后一次相聚吗
we're all gonna be together as a family until after the holidays?

65
00:02:03,634 --> 00:02:05,494
对你来说 可能是人生最后一次了
And for you, maybe ever.

66
00:02:05,494 --> 00:02:06,774
这太糟了
Well, this stinks.

67
00:02:06,803 --> 00:02:07,843
对啊 这可不行 不能这样
Yeah, we can't do this. This is not right.

68
00:02:07,843 --> 00:02:08,693
圣诞节一直都是一起过的
We always spend Christmas together.

69
00:02:08,693 --> 00:02:10,993
对 我们得想想法子才行
Yeah, we have to do something about it.

70
00:02:10,993 --> 00:02:13,553
等 等等 大家收声
Ho, ho, hold up a sec.

71
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:15,840
我们今天都没事
We're all free today.

72
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:19,040
有4个小时可以购物 煮菜 包礼物 买圣诞树
We've got four hours to shop, cook, wrap, get a tree.

73
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:19,820
到了晚上
By tonight,

74
00:02:19,852 --> 00:02:21,902
我们就可以共度圣诞不是吗
we could be celebrating Christmas, right?

75
00:02:21,912 --> 00:02:22,833
我觉得应该可行
I-I guess we could do that.

76
00:02:22,852 --> 00:02:24,022
当然可行啦
Of course we can!

77
00:02:24,031 --> 00:02:25,652
你们听说过"特快圣诞"吗
Have you ever heard of express Christmas?

78
00:02:25,721 --> 00:02:27,771
-没有 -肯定没有 这是我刚发明的
- No. - No, you haven't, because I just invented it.

79
00:02:27,781 --> 00:02:29,651
特快圣诞 菲尔专利
Express Christmas, "Tm."

80
00:02:29,651 --> 00:02:31,471
-就是无法圣诞当天庆祝节日... -我明白
- It's when you can't have it on Christmas day... - I got it.

81
00:02:31,491 --> 00:02:33,080
-只好提前速成 -行动吧
- And you have to scramble. - Get on with it!

82
00:02:33,090 --> 00:02:34,820
-行了行了 -大家速度 时间不等人
- Yeah, yeah... - We're wasting time! We're wasting time!

83
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:37,220
全体进屋 好好计划一下
Everyone in the house! We'll make a plan!

84
00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:40,600
时间不等... 烫 地面晒得好烫
Time is of the--oh! Ow! Hot! Hot! It's just too hot!

85
00:02:40,610 --> 00:02:42,309
-菲尔小心 -啊呀
- Oh, Phil! - Aah!

86
00:02:54,338 --> 00:02:56,308
-我们真要这么做吗 -对
- So we're really doing this, huh? - Yes.

87
00:02:56,308 --> 00:02:58,478
-当然了 -平安夜事项我都安排好了
- Yeah. - 'cause I had stuff lined up for Christmas Eve.

88
00:02:58,478 --> 00:02:59,407
当然了 杰
Yeah, Jay.

89
00:02:59,407 --> 00:03:02,777
也是曼尼享受家庭圣诞的最后机会哦
It's Manny's last chance to enjoy a family Christmas.

90
00:03:02,797 --> 00:03:04,318
你是想说 今年的最后机会吧
Until next year, you mean.

91
00:03:04,327 --> 00:03:06,457
那么多人贩子...
Well, with all the snatchings...

92
00:03:06,467 --> 00:03:07,757
别吓我了 卢克
Get out of my head, Luke!

93
00:03:07,767 --> 00:03:09,336
好 谁去买圣诞树
Okay, who's gonna get the tree?

94
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:10,380
我去我去
Oh! I will. I will.

95
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:13,000
一旦买错 有人会不高兴的
Because, you know, get the wrong kind, people get upset.

96
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,920
-只有你会不高兴 -我也是人
- You get upset. - I'm people.

97
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:17,080
好 我去买火鸡 礼物呢
Fine, I'll get the turkey. What about gifts?

98
00:03:17,155 --> 00:03:18,525
杰 礼物都买了吗
Jay, did we finish shopping?

99
00:03:18,525 --> 00:03:19,696
买完了 不过还没包好
Yeah, but we're not wrapped.

100
00:03:19,715 --> 00:03:20,535
那个我可以帮忙
Oh, I can help with that.

101
00:03:20,535 --> 00:03:21,696
我们有个可移动礼品包装站
We have a mobile wrapping station.

102
00:03:21,715 --> 00:03:23,185
那家伙 可真是物超所值
God, has that thing paid for itself.

103
00:03:23,185 --> 00:03:24,885
是吗 我怎么觉得是我买的单
Really? Cause I feel like I paid for it.

104
00:03:24,915 --> 00:03:27,164
行 灯和装饰品在我们家
Okay. We've got lights and ornaments at our place.

105
00:03:27,164 --> 00:03:28,434
万事俱备 只差什么呢
Oh! You know what would be great?

106
00:03:28,454 --> 00:03:29,944
-只差小天使 -小天使
- Is the angel! - The angel.

107
00:03:29,954 --> 00:03:31,475
-对 在哪呢 -歌洛莉亚
- Yeah. Where is it? - Oh. Um, Gloria,

108
00:03:31,484 --> 00:03:32,774
在你阁楼里呢 你能去找下吗
It's up in your attic. Would you get it?

109
00:03:32,794 --> 00:03:34,375
不是吧 最讨厌阁楼了
Ay, no! Not the attic!

110
00:03:34,394 --> 00:03:37,283
又脏又乱 还有蜘蛛
It's dirty, and there are spiders.

111
00:03:37,293 --> 00:03:39,193
但如果不拿的话 就没有圣诞气氛了
Oh, but it really won't be Christmas without it.

112
00:03:39,213 --> 00:03:41,403
就算拿了也没有圣诞气氛 今天才12月16号
Won't be Christmas with it. It's December 16th.

113
00:03:41,433 --> 00:03:43,352
卢克可以帮歌洛莉亚找 他不害怕
Luke will help Gloria. He's not scared.

114
00:03:43,352 --> 00:03:45,722
太好了 阁楼那种地方我从不去
Oh, good. You won't find me in any attic.

115
00:03:45,732 --> 00:03:48,182
或许你的尸体最终就在阁楼里被发现的
That may be exactly where they find you.

116
00:03:48,460 --> 00:03:49,040
妈
Mom!

117
00:03:49,502 --> 00:03:50,782
我今晚有个派对
Uh, I have a party tonight.

118
00:03:50,782 --> 00:03:53,211
你说过如果考试拿到B 我就可以去的
You promised I could go if I got a "B" On my test.

119
00:03:53,220 --> 00:03:54,820
我忍痛复习了 我屈尊翻书了
I studied. I read stuff.

120
00:03:54,820 --> 00:03:55,800
不让去的话 我学习有什么意义啊
What was the point of all that?

121
00:03:55,801 --> 00:03:57,641
-学习的意义在于 姑娘 -你们忘了吗
- The point, young lady ... - Who can remember,

122
00:03:57,641 --> 00:04:00,031
特快圣诞9点就要完工的
Express Christmas will be done by 9:00.

123
00:04:00,031 --> 00:04:01,400
克莱尔 我待会把礼物清单短信给你
Claire, I'll text you the gift list.

124
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:01,700
行
Okay.

125
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:03,060
你跟海莉去购物
You and Haley do the shopping.

126
00:04:03,060 --> 00:04:05,360
曼尼 你跟我一起 我们去置办年货
Manny, you're coming with me. We're gonna get groceries.

127
00:04:05,450 --> 00:04:07,700
6点晚餐 齐聚我家 不见不散
Dinner, our house, 6:00.

128
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:08,360
行动吧
Let's move!

129
00:04:09,380 --> 00:04:14,080
飞驰吧 阿冲 小舞 跳豆 悍妇
On Dasher! On Dancer! On Prancer and Vixen!

130
00:04:14,399 --> 00:04:16,060
嘿 我真是妙语连珠啊
Hey, that kind of worked out.

131
00:04:16,620 --> 00:04:17,540
别磨蹭了 海莉
Come on, Haley.

132
00:04:17,579 --> 00:04:18,968
杰 你肯定会爱死这包装纸
Jay, you are gonna love this wrapping paper--

133
00:04:18,968 --> 00:04:19,708
很有趣的
It'll be fun.

134
00:04:19,708 --> 00:04:22,258
很好玩的 我们去塔吉特好吗
A lot of fun. We can go to Target. Okay?

135
00:04:22,258 --> 00:04:23,478
-伙计们 我在想 -出门了出门了
- I was just wo-- you guys. - Let's go! Let's go!

136
00:04:23,478 --> 00:04:24,759
快点 走啦
Come on, let's go!

137
00:04:25,688 --> 00:04:27,917
这么说 就我跟莉莉去买树吗
So it's--it's just me and Lily getting the tree, then?

138
00:04:29,287 --> 00:04:31,077
-有人吗 -有人吗
- Hello? - Hello?

139
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:34,100
我妈发短信告诉我今天"圣快"?
My mom tells me it's "Xmas" in a text?

140
00:04:34,177 --> 00:04:36,247
总比我妈好 甩条留言就放我们鸽子
Yeah, well, my mom canceled in a voice mail

141
00:04:36,256 --> 00:04:37,996
用条简讯通知我们她谈了新男友
and told me she had a boyfriend in a newsletter,

142
00:04:38,006 --> 00:04:40,246
所以 欢迎加入悲情二人组
So... Join the team.

143
00:04:40,266 --> 00:04:42,086
穿上外套吧 咱要去买圣诞树
Put some clothes on. We're getting a tree.

144
00:04:47,555 --> 00:04:48,806
卢克
Luke!

145
00:04:48,995 --> 00:04:49,785
看哪儿
At what?

146
00:04:49,785 --> 00:04:51,915
什么叫"看哪儿" 我说的是"卢克"
What do you mean, "at what"? I said "Luke."

147
00:04:51,915 --> 00:04:53,635
我在看啊
I am looking.

148
00:04:53,645 --> 00:04:57,064
我知道你在看 乖乖待在横梁上
I know you are. Stay on the beams.

149
00:04:57,064 --> 00:04:58,585
可能在这儿
Maybe it's here.

150
00:04:59,694 --> 00:05:02,654
天呐 见鬼了 又来了
Ay, dios mio! El diablo! It's back!

151
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:07,620
话说 那小天使有什么特别的
What is so special about that angel, anyways?

152
00:05:07,620 --> 00:05:08,960
我不知道
I don't know.

153
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,980
估计是外婆给妈妈和米奇尔舅舅做的
I guess nana made it for mom and uncle Mitchell

154
00:05:10,980 --> 00:05:11,960
小时候的玩具
when they were kids.

155
00:05:11,962 --> 00:05:14,252
哇 真幸福
Ay, that's nice.

156
00:05:15,322 --> 00:05:17,022
"看着"脚下[歧义:卢克 你去哪]
Look where you're going!

157
00:05:17,032 --> 00:05:18,413
去开其他箱子
To open more boxes.

158
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:25,180
你刚刚说的是"小心脚下的地板" 是吗
Oh, you said "look where you're going," didn't you?

159
00:05:26,340 --> 00:05:26,900
是的
Yes.

160
00:05:27,061 --> 00:05:28,371
每次你说"卢克"的时候
Every time you said "Luke",

161
00:05:28,371 --> 00:05:29,920
我都以为你说的是"看"
I though you said "look".

162
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,541
我觉得发音一样啊
I don't hear the difference.

163
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,840
不难区分的 "一个"是我的名字
It's not that hard. One is my name.

164
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:35,181
你才不叫"一哥"呢
Juan is not your name!

165
00:05:35,190 --> 00:05:38,249
别老开玩笑 看着点 卢克
Stop kidding around and look, Luke!

166
00:05:38,249 --> 00:05:41,909
我懂了 "看"听起来和"卢克"很像
Ay, I get it. "look" sounds like "Luke."

167
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,100
你终于懂了 感谢上帝
Yes. Thank god.

168
00:05:44,340 --> 00:05:47,300
我都被你叫错三年了
I've been carrying that one around for three years.

169
00:05:48,548 --> 00:05:51,258
天呐 购物清单列了近百条
Ugh. There's like a hundred things on this list.

170
00:05:51,258 --> 00:05:53,548
我知道 母女同心 其利断金 多有趣啊
I know, but it's just the two of us. It's fun.

171
00:05:53,548 --> 00:05:55,667
拜托 是假圣诞节 又不是假装母亲节
Okay, it's not Fake Mother's Day.

172
00:05:55,947 --> 00:05:58,217
这个地方实在太大了
Ugh! This place is huge!

173
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:00,640
而且我们还要做晚餐
Oh, plus we have to cook dinner!

174
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:01,720
简直是不可能完成的任务
This is impossible.

175
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,640
听着
Listen to me.

176
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:06,460
你前半生的努力 就为此一战
Your whole life has led to this moment.

177
00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:10,120
所有的训练 付出的时间
All the training, the hours of dedication...

178
00:06:10,906 --> 00:06:12,896
世上简直没有任何人
There's not a soul alive who can touch you

179
00:06:12,906 --> 00:06:13,785
在购物上能比得过你
when it comes to shopping,

180
00:06:13,785 --> 00:06:15,226
宝贝儿 你是知道的
and, baby, you know it.

181
00:06:15,255 --> 00:06:15,797
看着我
Look at me.

182
00:06:18,620 --> 00:06:19,740
拿出你的本事来
Be you.

183
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:21,540
把清单给我
Give me that list.

184
00:06:21,605 --> 00:06:23,464
真心自豪啊
Never been more proud in my life.

185
00:06:23,464 --> 00:06:24,255
-来吧 -等等
- Come on. - No.

186
00:06:28,500 --> 00:06:29,620
走这边
This way.

187
00:06:31,460 --> 00:06:32,580
这棵怎么样
What about this one?

188
00:06:32,753 --> 00:06:34,523
让我看看 不 不行
Let's see. No. No.

189
00:06:34,543 --> 00:06:36,413
对不起 我知道我现在有点强迫症
I'm sorry, I know I'm being really O.C.D. right now,

190
00:06:36,463 --> 00:06:38,553
但我想找到完全合意的那一棵
But there's something very particular that I'm looking for.

191
00:06:38,563 --> 00:06:41,652
必须是花旗松 至少8英尺高
It needs to be a douglas fir, at least 8 feet tall,

192
00:06:41,662 --> 00:06:43,232
而且360度无死角
and look good from all sides.

193
00:06:43,262 --> 00:06:44,683
完全同意 不能有秃枝
Exactly. No bald spots.

194
00:06:44,702 --> 00:06:46,392
对 谢谢理解
Yes. Thank you. Thank you.

195
00:06:46,402 --> 00:06:48,292
关键是要对称的树 是吧
The key is symmetry, right?

196
00:06:48,302 --> 00:06:52,261
*哦 对称树 哦 对称树*
* O, symmetry. O, symmetry *

197
00:06:52,261 --> 00:06:54,141
为什么我们从来没有一起逛过街
How come we never go shopping together?

198
00:06:54,141 --> 00:06:55,971
-因为我讨厌逛街 -我也是
- Because I hate shopping. - I do, too!

199
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:58,040
-来看看这棵 -看看
- Okay, this one. - Wait.

200
00:06:58,460 --> 00:07:00,010
-不行不行 -不行 完全不行
- Oh. No, no, no. - Oh, no, no, no, no.

201
00:07:00,060 --> 00:07:01,810
我大概知道你们想要哪种了
Uh, I think I know what you're looking for,

202
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:04,340
我们刚到一批货 一定合你们心意
And we just got a shipment that might be perfect for you.

203
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,720
没搞错吧
Okay, wow.

204
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:10,700
虽然我舅舅基态毕露
Just because my uncle is clearly gay...

205
00:07:10,989 --> 00:07:13,959
-先别 -但未必就喜欢你们的恶俗粉红树
- Let's not... - doesn't mean he'd ever want your tacky pink tree.

206
00:07:13,979 --> 00:07:16,148
坦白讲 我们宁愿把衣帽架改成圣诞树
And frankly, we'd rather throw some lights on a coatrack

207
00:07:16,158 --> 00:07:17,878
也不愿意跟你这种肥仔做买卖
than have to deal with knuckle-draggers like you

208
00:07:17,980 --> 00:07:19,260
白白糟蹋了这大好节日
today of all days.

209
00:07:20,378 --> 00:07:21,988
12月16日
December 16th.

210
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,820
好吧 首先呢 了不起的演讲
Okay, first of all, amazing.

211
00:07:25,257 --> 00:07:27,207
-再者 -我指的是那辆卡车
- Second of all... - I was pointing to the truck.

212
00:07:27,237 --> 00:07:29,427
里面都是8英尺高的花旗松
It's full of 8-foot douglas-firs.

213
00:07:29,437 --> 00:07:30,758
在那棵粉色小树后面
It's behind the pink tree.

214
00:07:30,777 --> 00:07:32,626
再者
Second of all,

215
00:07:32,646 --> 00:07:35,376
我们 我们打算买这棵 这棵树
Uh, we're--we're gonna go ahead and take, uh, this--this tree...

216
00:07:35,396 --> 00:07:36,726
就那棵
That one.

217
00:07:36,726 --> 00:07:38,696
而且我们打算自己把它运到车上
And we're going to tie it onto our car ourselves.

218
00:07:38,820 --> 00:07:39,910
我也没打算帮你
You bet you will.

219
00:07:41,386 --> 00:07:43,415
-我有两个爹地 -人家懂的 莉莉
- I have two daddies. - He gets it, Lily.

220
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:54,080
小卡和杰 听起来像小鸟的名字
Cam and Jay--you know, sort of sounds like a bird.

221
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:56,780
"小卡和杰的迁徙路线"
"The migratory patterns of the Cam and Jay..."

222
00:07:57,384 --> 00:07:59,074
你那抽屉里还有胶带吗
Do you have any more tape in that thing?

223
00:07:59,083 --> 00:08:00,683
我那抽屉里还有没有胶带呢
Do I have more tape in that?

224
00:08:00,683 --> 00:08:02,243
有满满一箱呢 先生
I got a tank full of tape, Mister.

225
00:08:02,243 --> 00:08:04,393
你想要哪种 透明胶 抛光胶
What do you want? Invisible? Satin finish?

226
00:08:04,393 --> 00:08:06,443
-还是双面胶 -随便 都行
- Uh, double-sided? - Whatever. Whatever.

227
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:12,180
有点儿意思
That's interesting.

228
00:08:12,180 --> 00:08:13,920
我可不觉得 不过你指的什么
I doubt that it is, but what?

229
00:08:13,932 --> 00:08:15,942
我是说你包礼物的方式
Well, I mean the way you wrap a gift.

230
00:08:15,952 --> 00:08:18,741
你用了很多胶带 像是对别人设防
That's a lot of tape. Nobody can get in.

231
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:21,080
就好像 你知道的
Kind of like... You know...

232
00:08:22,211 --> 00:08:24,551
我想说 你接受了我
I mean, well, you let me in,

233
00:08:24,561 --> 00:08:26,750
但是总体来说
But in general, w--

234
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:28,321
为什么要用那么多胶带呢 杰
Why so much tape, Jay?

235
00:08:28,330 --> 00:08:29,680
你穿毛衣干什么
Why are you wearing a sweater

236
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:31,120
外面现在95华氏度[约35摄氏度]
when it's 95 degrees out?

237
00:08:31,220 --> 00:08:32,920
这是我的圣诞毛衫啊
It's my Christmas sweater.

238
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:33,820
上面汗迹斑斑
Based on those stains,

239
00:08:33,820 --> 00:08:36,080
你是圣诞"汗衫"才对吧
you are the Christmas sweater.

240
00:08:37,860 --> 00:08:40,230
看看 谁是最孝顺的人
Well, who's been a very good boy?

241
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:44,900
来
So...

242
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:53,520
好吧 我们直接"打开天窗说亮话"
Okay. Are we gonna talk about the elephant in the room,

243
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:54,900
不过真讽刺 礼物跟大象比实在太小了
which is ironic because it's so tiny?

244
00:08:54,900 --> 00:08:58,560
男人之间不会送这么小只的礼物
A man doesn't give another man a gift this small.

245
00:08:58,660 --> 00:08:59,760
你以为那是什么 求婚戒指吗
Oh, what do you think it is, a ring?

246
00:09:07,296 --> 00:09:08,486
这瓶塞是有塞着酒的吧
Was there wine with this cork?

247
00:09:08,486 --> 00:09:09,986
没错 喝这酒的时候我们在
Yes, there was, and we drank it on...

248
00:09:09,995 --> 00:09:11,256
喝这酒的时候我们在...什么
Oh, we drank it on, uh... Eh?

249
00:09:12,180 --> 00:09:14,200
在那艘船上
On that boat.

250
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:16,780
你完全不记得了
You have no idea.

251
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:19,040
小卡 我连自己的周年纪念日都记不住
I can't even remember my own anniversary, Cam.

252
00:09:19,074 --> 00:09:22,864
怎么还会记得和儿婿喝酒的事儿
How would I have remembered having had wine with my son's boyfriend?

253
00:09:22,874 --> 00:09:24,694
不 我总是这样 这是我的错
No, I do this. This is my fault.

254
00:09:24,714 --> 00:09:27,293
我赋予了这东西太多的感情意义
I-I attach too much meaning to things.

255
00:09:27,660 --> 00:09:31,340
5年前 那是我们第一次同看橄榄球比赛
I mean, we watched our first football game together five years ago,

256
00:09:31,363 --> 00:09:32,813
那时你用一瓶酒招待我
and I feel the need to save the cork

257
00:09:32,813 --> 00:09:34,334
我觉得意义重大 故把瓶塞留作纪念
from the bottle of wine you served.

258
00:09:34,343 --> 00:09:35,514
谁会做这样的傻事呢
I mean, who does that?

259
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:37,100
对了 这不是我送你的唯一礼物
It's not your only gift, by the way.

260
00:09:37,162 --> 00:09:39,032
那儿的盒子里有一个复制的酒瓶
There's a duplicate bottle in that box right over there

261
00:09:39,032 --> 00:09:40,882
上面有我亲手刻的日期
which I had engraved with the date

262
00:09:40,892 --> 00:09:43,582
还有比赛得分 我就是有问题
and the final score, because I have a problem.

263
00:09:43,602 --> 00:09:44,222
太多愁善感
I feel too much.

264
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:45,760
我得去克莱尔那儿逛逛
I gotta get going to Claire's.

265
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:48,400
-小卡 -不 新伤脆弱 请别撒盐
- Cam...- No. Fresh wound. Can't talk yet.

266
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,880
行 就用瓶塞塞住伤口吧
Fine. We'll put a cork in it.

267
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:51,940
让伤口愈合吧 杰
Let it scab, Jay.

268
00:09:51,940 --> 00:09:54,100
让伤口慢慢愈合
Let it scab.

269
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,900
你在这呢 我还以为你走丢了
Oh, there you are. I thought I'd lost you.

270
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:06,460
不好意思 我刚刚试了下蒲团
Oh, I'm sorry. I may have taken a few minutes to try out a futon.

271
00:10:06,759 --> 00:10:07,579
那是给年轻姑娘用的
It's a young woman's game.

272
00:10:07,579 --> 00:10:09,279
好了 进展如何
Okay. Where do we stand?

273
00:10:09,279 --> 00:10:10,979
-万事俱备 -太棒了
- I think we have everything. - Yes!

274
00:10:10,979 --> 00:10:13,518
只欠莉莉的瓢虫小夜灯
Oh... Except the ladybug night-light for Lily.

275
00:10:16,088 --> 00:10:17,098
海莉 你此生就为了此刻...
Haley, your whole life has led up...

276
00:10:17,098 --> 00:10:17,968
明白 妈 明白得很
Oh, I got it, Mom, I got it.

277
00:10:17,968 --> 00:10:19,289
那就好 我先去排队
Okay, okay, I'll b-- I'll see you in the line.

278
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:36,080
喂 罗纳德
Yes, Ronald?

279
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:38,860
终于找到了 还是最后一个
I not only found it, I got the last one.

280
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:41,560
没错 瓢虫的 不是海龟的
Yes, the ladybug, not the turtle.

281
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:44,260
玩偶也买到了 一切俱全
I also got the doll, so I'm all set.

282
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:49,380
我再逛五分钟就走
I'm gonna leave in five.

283
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:54,780
要不就用纸袋吧
Or maybe I just want paper.

284
00:10:54,780 --> 00:10:56,900
纸袋 纸袋 都用纸袋
Paper. Paper. Just paper all the way. Yeah.

285
00:10:56,900 --> 00:10:57,300
海莉快点啊
Haley!

286
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,620
我能再改变主意吗
Too late to change my mind?

287
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:06,200
先生 需要我帮您拿着手中商品
Sir, would you like me to hold your merchandise

288
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:08,080
等您逛完了 我在收银台等您
up at the register while you finish shopping?

289
00:11:08,220 --> 00:11:09,280
你真贴心
Oh. Aren't you a dream?

290
00:11:09,342 --> 00:11:10,333
谢谢
Thank you.

291
00:11:15,691 --> 00:11:16,682
来包口香糖
Pack of gum.

292
00:11:19,131 --> 00:11:22,380
再...来包口香糖
And... One more pack of gum.

293
00:11:24,690 --> 00:11:26,530
逢年过节人们总爱登门拜访 你懂的
People drop in this time of year, you know.

294
00:11:26,890 --> 00:11:28,730
不好意思 抱歉 借过
Excuse me. Sorry. Pardon me.

295
00:11:28,730 --> 00:11:30,011
抱歉 不好意思
Sorry. Excuse me.

296
00:11:30,730 --> 00:11:32,299
女士 这是您要的小夜灯
Night-light you were looking for, ma'am.

297
00:11:32,359 --> 00:11:33,359
帮她刷一下 麦迪森
Ring her up, Madison.

298
00:11:33,359 --> 00:11:34,440
多谢
Thank you.

299
00:11:35,620 --> 00:11:37,220
给
There you go.

300
00:11:40,180 --> 00:11:41,520
你要把我一个人扔这吗
You're leaving me alone here?

301
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:42,360
不不不不 我...
No, no, no, no. I...

302
00:11:42,498 --> 00:11:44,968
两分钟后就回
It'll, uh, it'll just take me two minutes.

303
00:11:44,968 --> 00:11:47,378
我得给杰买一个绝密又特别的礼物
I need to get Jay's supersecret special gift.

304
00:11:47,378 --> 00:11:49,487
骗谁呢 先是在杂货店让我走丢
Great. First you lose me in the grocery store,

305
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:51,200
现在又把我丢在废弃的停车场
now I'm in a deserted parking lot.

306
00:11:51,380 --> 00:11:52,960
干脆在我身上贴一张"求领养"的字条得了
Why don't you just put a sign on me that says "Free kid"?

307
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:55,200
我觉得那人就是了
I think that might be him.

308
00:11:55,300 --> 00:11:56,560
你都不知道对方是谁啊
You don't know the guy we're meeting?

309
00:11:56,980 --> 00:11:58,440
分类广告网站就是那样的
That's how Craigslist works.

310
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:59,800
你从陌生人那买到东西
Total strangers sell you things

311
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,140
比如说老的签名棒球卡
like signed vintage baseball cards

312
00:12:01,140 --> 00:12:03,360
整个下午岳父都会对我肃然起敬
that make your father-in-law respect you for an afternoon.

313
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:05,100
我觉得来者不善
I don't like the looks of this guy.

314
00:12:05,826 --> 00:12:07,175
他就是一普通人啊
He looks like everybody else.

315
00:12:07,175 --> 00:12:09,605
回头你也这么跟警察说吧 犯罪画像专家
Great. You can just tell that to the police, sketch artist.

316
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:12,560
买乔·德玛吉奥的吗
Joe Dimaggio?

317
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:15,000
我是菲尔·邓菲 不过经常有人认错
Phil Dunphy, but I get that a lot.

318
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,240
开个玩笑 我就是买家
Kidding. I'm your guy.

319
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:17,500
能看看现金吗
Can I see the cash?

320
00:12:17,680 --> 00:12:21,400
可以 那 那能看看卡吗
Yes. Can I... Can I see the card?

321
00:12:24,443 --> 00:12:25,793
保存得真完好啊
Mint condition.

322
00:12:26,540 --> 00:12:28,060
所以我得加价五十
That's why I want another $50.

323
00:12:28,093 --> 00:12:29,793
我身上就两百
I only have the $200.

324
00:12:30,043 --> 00:12:31,143
那算了
Uh, deal's off, then.

325
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:32,360
别啊 今天可是圣诞节
Come on. It's Christmas...

326
00:12:33,740 --> 00:12:36,460
我家的圣诞节 说来话长
At our house. It's a long story.

327
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:40,240
我刚刚把现金都花了
I just spent all my cash on groceries.

328
00:12:40,322 --> 00:12:42,061
好吧 那把"小胖墩"给我
Fine. But I'm taking the butterball.

329
00:12:42,061 --> 00:12:43,661
-那样不好吧 -够了
- I don't know about that. - That's it.

330
00:12:43,661 --> 00:12:44,961
我要出动妈妈小帮手了
I'm getting mother's little helper.

331
00:12:44,961 --> 00:12:47,141
-什么 -我妈给了一把电击枪以防不测
- What? - My mom keeps a stun gun for emergencies.

332
00:12:47,141 --> 00:12:48,531
哪有什么不测...
This isn't an emergen--

333
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:55,120
现在有了
Now it is.

334
00:13:01,459 --> 00:13:03,019
我以为他要绑架我
I thought he was going to snatch me.

335
00:13:03,019 --> 00:13:06,479
"小胖墩"不是说你
A butterball isn't...

336
00:13:06,829 --> 00:13:07,619
他说什么
What'd he say?

337
00:13:07,619 --> 00:13:09,738
我觉得好像是 "小胖墩指的是火鸡"
I think he said, "A butterball's a turkey."

338
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,400
我刚要去拿火鸡来着
I was reaching for the turkey.

339
00:13:12,740 --> 00:13:14,660
你不能把火鸡拿走
Oh. Well, we can't give you our turkey.

340
00:13:16,398 --> 00:13:17,718
让他拿吧
Yes, we can.

341
00:13:17,827 --> 00:13:20,817
把钱拿走
And... Here's the... money.

342
00:13:26,466 --> 00:13:27,847
球卡给我
Joe Dimaggio!

343
00:13:28,376 --> 00:13:30,026
球卡给我
Joe Dimaggio.

344
00:13:30,566 --> 00:13:31,717
谢了
Thanks.

345
00:13:34,645 --> 00:13:35,746
完好无损
Mint condit--

346
00:13:38,945 --> 00:13:41,515
近乎完好
Near-mint con--

347
00:13:43,964 --> 00:13:45,545
可以将就
Fair condit--

348
00:13:48,444 --> 00:13:50,114
废纸一张
Garbage.

349
00:13:59,213 --> 00:14:00,634
我从没见过这个
Huh. Never saw this before.

350
00:14:00,872 --> 00:14:03,372
"给宝贝们的天使 爱你们的妈妈"
"An angel for my angels. Love, Mom."

351
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:04,540
真温馨
Oh, that's beautiful.

352
00:14:05,652 --> 00:14:08,242
而且闻起来就像外婆身上的樟脑丸味
And it smells like mothballs, just like nana.

353
00:14:08,242 --> 00:14:09,482
卢克...
Luke...

354
00:14:09,521 --> 00:14:11,531
-谢...圣诞快乐 -别徒劳了
- Thank--Merry Christmas. - Just--just give it up.

355
00:14:13,380 --> 00:14:14,880
他恨我们
He hates us.

356
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:16,280
别妄自菲薄
Don't beat yourself up.

357
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:18,180
我几乎每周都会碰上这种事
I do that, like, once a week.

358
00:14:18,180 --> 00:14:21,300
往好了想 咱以后不会来了
The good news is, we never have to come back here.

359
00:14:21,850 --> 00:14:22,941
当心
Watch out!

360
00:14:24,270 --> 00:14:26,420
-树遭殃了 -我不忍心看
- The tree! - I can't watch!

361
00:14:26,450 --> 00:14:27,110
看
Look!

362
00:14:27,110 --> 00:14:28,679
对啊 我说的就是"卢克"
Ay, yes, I said "Luke".

363
00:14:28,679 --> 00:14:29,809
你纠正过我 我发音是对的啊
You told me already. I did it right!

364
00:14:29,809 --> 00:14:31,219
不是 我让你看
No! Look!

365
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:35,420
好汉不回头 别回头
Never look back. Never!

366
00:14:38,300 --> 00:14:40,620
或许还有抢救的机会
Maybe we can salvage it?

367
00:14:45,607 --> 00:14:46,877
没吓坏吧 宝贝
Are you okay, papi?

368
00:14:47,140 --> 00:14:47,580
没事
Yeah.

369
00:14:48,027 --> 00:14:51,117
那就好 因为我们有天使守护啊
Good. That's because we had our guardian angel.

370
00:14:51,117 --> 00:14:53,087
妈呀 蜘蛛
Ay! A spider!

371
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:01,920
妈
Hey, mom?

372
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:03,120
瞧瞧
Check it.

373
00:15:04,025 --> 00:15:04,835
口香糖
The gum!

374
00:15:04,835 --> 00:15:08,015
你摆得真漂亮 宝贝 放桌上
Oh, and you made it pretty. Honey, put it on the table.

375
00:15:08,060 --> 00:15:10,560
-也算新传统了吗 -当然
- New tradition? - Oh, yes. Yes.

376
00:15:11,820 --> 00:15:13,300
圣诞口香糖
Christmas gum.

377
00:15:13,854 --> 00:15:14,925
我尝尝
I take one.

378
00:15:16,144 --> 00:15:18,404
好汉难为无"树"之饰啊 对吧
Tough to decorate the tree with no tree, huh?

379
00:15:21,423 --> 00:15:23,093
你打算什么时候理我啊小卡
How long you gonna ignore me, cam?

380
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:24,460
直到人家心中云淡风轻
Until the shame cloud clears.

381
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:26,840
我就这样 我喜欢主动 强人所难
You know, I push. I'm a pusher.

382
00:15:26,863 --> 00:15:27,943
你得好好冷静一下
You gotta give yourself a break.

383
00:15:27,943 --> 00:15:29,133
其实吧 我这人
See, the thing about me,

384
00:15:29,500 --> 00:15:31,640
我不像你那么热衷于表达情感
I'm not as open with feelings as you.

385
00:15:32,332 --> 00:15:34,472
你不能期望每个人都像你那样
You've gotta lower your expectations.

386
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:35,580
我懂了
Oh, I get it.

387
00:15:36,340 --> 00:15:37,820
-小步小步地来 -一步都要不得
- Baby steps. - No steps.

388
00:15:38,020 --> 00:15:39,100
就这么着
This is it.

389
00:15:39,660 --> 00:15:40,980
瞧 我又自作自受了
See? Did it again.

390
00:15:40,991 --> 00:15:42,331
推 推 推 推
Push! Push, push, push, push.

391
00:15:42,331 --> 00:15:43,561
我都把你推出房间了
Now I've pushed you out of the room.

392
00:15:43,561 --> 00:15:44,891
就那样吧
That's fine.

393
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,140
修好了吗
How is she?

394
00:15:47,140 --> 00:15:48,880
我把她翅膀上的轮胎印给擦了
I got the tire marks off her wings,

395
00:15:48,900 --> 00:15:50,400
但头接不上了
but I can't get her head to stay on.

396
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:52,720
该口香糖大显身手了
Okay, that's what this is for.

397
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,760
把它粘在脖子那儿
Now stick it in the top of the tree

398
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:57,799
让没坏的地方朝外 来吧
with the good part facing out. Come on.

399
00:15:58,249 --> 00:15:59,499
填充馅料看起来不错啊
Well, that stuffing looks good.

400
00:15:59,580 --> 00:16:01,460
现在只需要一只火鸡将之包起来
All we need now is a turkey to surround it.

401
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,880
放松啦 菲尔刚发来短信
Well, relax. Phil just texted,

402
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:04,720
说他"马上就到蜡"
and he's "On his wax."

403
00:16:05,580 --> 00:16:07,900
好了 圣诞树驾到
Okay! Here comes the tree.

404
00:16:08,008 --> 00:16:09,239
终于到了
Oh! Finally!

405
00:16:09,728 --> 00:16:11,748
-圣诞树残肢也驾到了 -嗨 宝贝
- Here comes more of the tree. - Hi, honey.

406
00:16:12,278 --> 00:16:13,567
老天爷啊 什么情况啊
oh. Oh, my gosh. What happened?

407
00:16:13,567 --> 00:16:15,337
它遭遇了车祸
Well, uh, someone ran over it,

408
00:16:15,337 --> 00:16:18,107
不过没关系 我们会把树再拼起来
But that's okay 'cause we are gonna put it back together.

409
00:16:18,107 --> 00:16:19,047
马上拼好
Right now.

410
00:16:19,047 --> 00:16:20,628
那他得嚼不少口香糖啊
He's gonna need a lot of gum.

411
00:16:20,637 --> 00:16:22,916
感谢苍天 菲尔终于带着"小胖墩"回来了
Oh, thank god. Here comes phil and the butterball.

412
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:24,160
我有名字的
I have a name.

413
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:27,260
我很抱歉 没有火鸡
I am sorry, but there is no turkey.

414
00:16:27,260 --> 00:16:29,700
没有火鸡 不是都说好了吗 菲尔
There's no turkey? What's the plan, Phil?

415
00:16:29,766 --> 00:16:31,425
迷你童子鸡
Cornish game hens.

416
00:16:31,455 --> 00:16:33,075
如果你仔细看
If you get real close,

417
00:16:33,075 --> 00:16:35,895
跟火鸡神似 而且不用大家分着吃
They look like turkeys, and everyone gets their own.

418
00:16:35,895 --> 00:16:37,076
好有趣耶
Sounds like fun.

419
00:16:37,355 --> 00:16:38,385
一点趣也没有 一点没有
Not fun. Not fun.

420
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:40,980
我让你买的是烹饪过的火鸡
I asked you to pick up a cooked turkey.

421
00:16:40,980 --> 00:16:42,020
火鸡已经卖光了
The store was out of turkeys.

422
00:16:42,020 --> 00:16:43,620
离我们的"特快圣诞"只有一小时了
It was an hour to express Christmas.

423
00:16:43,620 --> 00:16:46,140
拜托 就凑合着用吧 好吗
Please, just make it work, okay? Please.

424
00:16:46,324 --> 00:16:47,614
这些鸡都没解冻
They're not even defrosted.

425
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:48,580
行 克莱尔
Fine, Claire.

426
00:16:48,603 --> 00:16:50,003
-你想给鸡解冻吗 -是啊
- You want 'em defrosted? - Yeah.

427
00:16:50,003 --> 00:16:51,003
圣...
Merry...

428
00:16:51,003 --> 00:16:51,974
他妹的
Freaking....

429
00:16:51,993 --> 00:16:52,873
诞快乐
Christmas!

430
00:16:52,873 --> 00:16:53,764
菲尔
Phil!

431
00:16:55,373 --> 00:16:56,613
那是我的电击枪吗
Is that my stun gun?

432
00:16:56,613 --> 00:16:58,202
没错 而且它还特好使呢
Yep. And it works great.

433
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:01,320
好吧 好吧
Okay. Okay.

434
00:17:02,052 --> 00:17:03,742
我们能行的 我们可以做到的
Um... We can make this work. This can work.

435
00:17:03,742 --> 00:17:06,391
爸 你和米奇尔把树重新拼好
Dad, you and Mitchell reassemble that tree.

436
00:17:06,391 --> 00:17:06,991
好的
All right.

437
00:17:06,991 --> 00:17:09,111
我来把这些小鸡解冻
And I am going to defrost these birds,

438
00:17:09,111 --> 00:17:09,911
然后我们一个一个来烤它们
and we'll cook them in shifts,

439
00:17:09,911 --> 00:17:11,911
然后我们把晚餐时间稍微延迟一下就好
And we'll just push dinner back by a bit.

440
00:17:11,911 --> 00:17:14,511
推多久啊 我还要参加派对呢
Oh, how long? 'Cause I still have my party.

441
00:17:14,511 --> 00:17:16,540
-这天使怎么了 -不
- What the hell happened to the angel? - No!

442
00:17:16,990 --> 00:17:18,340
现在真正的问题是
The real question here is,

443
00:17:18,340 --> 00:17:20,420
那个狗头装饰怎么还在我们家
how come we still have the dog butler?

444
00:17:20,420 --> 00:17:21,380
你在阁楼里发现了 是吧
Oh, you found him, huh?

445
00:17:21,380 --> 00:17:23,559
这天使 好 好脏啊
Well, this thing is-- it's filthy.

446
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:25,058
而且 怎么回事啊
And... What happened?!

447
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:27,560
它也遭遇车祸了
It got run over.

448
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:30,900
肇事者很有可能跟碾过树的是一个人
Probably by the same maniac who ran over the tree.

449
00:17:31,119 --> 00:17:32,049
我的天啊 这是
Oh, my God. Is that--

450
00:17:32,049 --> 00:17:33,948
是 是口香糖 口香糖
Yep. Yep, that's gum. That is gum.

451
00:17:33,948 --> 00:17:35,618
行 我 我不干了
Okay, I'm... I'm out.

452
00:17:35,618 --> 00:17:36,928
-米奇尔 -我退出 我不玩了
- Ah, Mitch... - I'm done. I am out.

453
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:39,200
不 火鸡也没有 树也没有
No. No turkey, no tree,

454
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:41,380
而且小天使看起来就像被五马分尸
And now this looks like the lady she used to be

455
00:17:41,380 --> 00:17:43,460
简直是成仙之前的惨相
before she died and became an angel.

456
00:17:43,460 --> 00:17:45,720
好了 放松 米奇尔 装饰而已
All right. Relax, Mitchell. It's an ornament.

457
00:17:45,780 --> 00:17:46,800
不是 他说的对
No, he's right.

458
00:17:46,857 --> 00:17:47,967
今年的圣诞节是没法好好过了
We're never gonna get this together.

459
00:17:47,967 --> 00:17:49,857
-我要去派对玩了 -不 你不能去
- I'm going to my party. - No, no. No, you're not.

460
00:17:49,857 --> 00:17:50,936
你不能去 你得呆在这
You are not. You're staying right here,

461
00:17:50,936 --> 00:17:54,026
因为你不能在圣诞节抛弃你的家人
Because you're not going to abandon your family on Christmas.

462
00:17:54,026 --> 00:17:54,816
这又不是圣诞节
It's not Christmas.

463
00:17:54,816 --> 00:17:57,456
就是 就是 这不是圣诞节 克莱尔
Exactly. Exactly. It's not Christmas, Claire.

464
00:17:58,246 --> 00:17:59,296
好啊 行
Okay, fine!

465
00:17:59,535 --> 00:18:00,215
行 说实话
Fine! You know what?

466
00:18:00,215 --> 00:18:03,265
全靠我一人努力 真是心力交瘁
I am really tired trying to make this work on my own.

467
00:18:03,300 --> 00:18:05,860
我们明年再见
I will see you people in a year.

468
00:18:05,860 --> 00:18:06,580
还得再加9天
And nine days.

469
00:18:06,900 --> 00:18:09,180
不行 谁都不许走
No! Nobody goes anywhere.

470
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:12,200
我知道问题出在哪里了
I know what the problem is here.

471
00:18:13,404 --> 00:18:15,054
你们两个想妈咪了
You two miss your mommy.

472
00:18:16,224 --> 00:18:18,063
没 我才没想妈咪呢
No. I do not miss my mommy.

473
00:18:18,063 --> 00:18:20,003
承认吧 是挺悲哀的
Admit it. It's sad.

474
00:18:20,083 --> 00:18:22,863
是她以前给你们烤饼干 还有那天使
She used to make you cookies, the angel...

475
00:18:22,863 --> 00:18:25,542
现在她却用简讯和你们聊天
Now she talks to you in a newsletter

476
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:27,360
而且她还无故放你们鸽子
And she cancels for no reason.

477
00:18:27,962 --> 00:18:29,882
到这来 我的小宝贝们
Come here, my little ones.

478
00:18:29,882 --> 00:18:30,502
不用了
No, it's fine.

479
00:18:30,502 --> 00:18:32,003
我们没事 没啥大不了的
We're good. It's not a big deal.

480
00:18:32,180 --> 00:18:34,340
今天是圣诞节 你们需要妈咪
It's Christmas. You need a mommy.

481
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:36,260
你又不是我们的妈咪
You're not our mommy.

482
00:18:37,031 --> 00:18:40,551
这也不是圣诞节啊 快过来
And it's not Christmas. Come here.

483
00:18:40,551 --> 00:18:42,351
想妈妈没啥大不了的
It's okay to miss her.

484
00:18:43,540 --> 00:18:45,900
我可以略微表达一下对"假圣诞"的看法吗
Can I put in my 2 cents on fake Christmas?

485
00:18:46,040 --> 00:18:47,000
是特快圣诞啦
Express Christmas.

486
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:49,120
算了吧 菲尔 强辩也无法使之成立
Let it go, Phil. It's not sticking.

487
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:49,920
它需要时间
It needs time.

488
00:18:51,040 --> 00:18:53,960
我们都为办好这事尽了最大努力了
We all gave it our best shot to make this thing work.

489
00:18:54,020 --> 00:18:55,640
但它就是成不了 对吧
It just didn't happen, all right?

490
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,360
我们现在仍可以扭转烂局
What do you say we cut our losses?

491
00:18:58,100 --> 00:19:00,040
去一家特好的中餐馆
Let's go out to a nice chinese restaurant

492
00:19:00,040 --> 00:19:02,860
然后过一个传统的犹太圣诞节怎么样
and have a traditional jewish Christmas.

493
00:19:02,888 --> 00:19:04,598
但是我还冒着生命危险去了杂货铺呢
But I risked my life grocery shopping.

494
00:19:04,598 --> 00:19:06,418
这故事你留着给王福讲吧
Save that story for Wang Fu.

495
00:19:06,418 --> 00:19:08,028
现在咱们走 出发 大家伙
Now let's go. Come on, everybody.

496
00:19:08,028 --> 00:19:10,717
我请客 大家都走
On me! Out! Everybody out!

497
00:19:10,997 --> 00:19:13,047
去王福那家 我请
Wang Fu's. It's on me.

498
00:19:13,047 --> 00:19:14,577
快走 来吧 宝贝
Let's go. Come on, baby girl.

499
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:16,020
快点 宝贝
Come on, honey.

500
00:19:22,556 --> 00:19:24,666
-什么情况 -太赞了
- What's going on? - Awesome!

501
00:19:29,635 --> 00:19:31,595
你讨厌中国菜
You hate chinese food.

502
00:19:36,324 --> 00:19:37,725
不赖吧
Not bad, huh?

503
00:19:39,020 --> 00:19:40,720
杰啊 杰啊 杰啊
Jay, Jay, Jay.

504
00:19:41,614 --> 00:19:43,734
-你想要抱我 是吧 -我是有点想
- You wanna hug me, don't you? - I kind of do.

505
00:19:43,884 --> 00:19:44,554
给你4/5秒
4 to 5 seconds.

506
00:19:44,554 --> 00:19:47,223
-能抱45秒 -4至5秒
- 45 seconds? - 4 to 5 seconds.

507
00:19:47,223 --> 00:19:48,244
好吧
Oh, okay.

508
00:19:52,780 --> 00:19:54,720
家人就是家人
Family is family.

509
00:19:55,042 --> 00:19:56,872
无论是生来就血脉相连的
Whether it's the one you start out with...

510
00:19:56,872 --> 00:19:57,902
-嗨 妈妈 -嗨 妈妈
- Hi, mom! - Hi, mom!

511
00:19:57,902 --> 00:19:59,232
圣诞快乐
Merry Christmas!

512
00:20:00,252 --> 00:20:01,842
那个 把你那个新男友的情况
So, um, tell us everything

513
00:20:01,842 --> 00:20:03,061
-都告诉我们 -没错
- about the new boyfriend. , yeah.

514
00:20:03,061 --> 00:20:04,381
一丝不落地全告诉我们哈
Don't leave anything out. Mm.

515
00:20:04,500 --> 00:20:05,580
私密性事就不要说了
You can leave some things out.

516
00:20:05,580 --> 00:20:07,410
亦或是相伴余生的
the one that you end up with...

517
00:20:09,840 --> 00:20:13,200
又或是开枝散叶 收获的小家庭
Or the family that you gain along the way...

518
00:20:17,560 --> 00:20:19,690
跟我一起 雪天使
Do this. Snow angels.

519
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:24,600
有家人在 每天都是
Which makes every day

520
00:20:24,619 --> 00:20:26,399
体验圣诞日
December 16th.

521
00:20:32,358 --> 00:20:35,038
杰 那个 不好意思把棒球卡弄坏了
Hey, Jay, um, I'm sorry about the baseball card.

522
00:20:35,038 --> 00:20:37,338
我又 又给你准备了一个备份礼物
I-I did get you a-a backup gift.

523
00:20:37,580 --> 00:20:40,600
其实没什么啦 我在加油的时候随手买的
It's--it's nothing. I picked it up when we stopped for gas.

524
00:20:42,247 --> 00:20:43,287
狗狗鹿角
Dog antlers.

525
00:20:43,287 --> 00:20:44,757
我知道 你给我们准备了雪
I know. You got us snow,

526
